usage: run_comparison.py [-h]
                         [--only {all,performance,inference,robustness,audit}]
                         [--universe {all,us_large,us_mid,eu_large}]
                         [--output OUTPUT] [--bootstrap-reps BOOTSTRAP_REPS]
                         [--seed SEED] [--run-tests]

Evaluate immutable saved Keats outputs. No model runners are imported or
invoked.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --only {all,performance,inference,robustness,audit}
  --universe {all,us_large,us_mid,eu_large}
  --output OUTPUT       New, non-existing directory under
                        keats_pipeline/outputs/ML comparison and reasoning
  --bootstrap-reps BOOTSTRAP_REPS
  --seed SEED
  --run-tests           Run comparison and existing Keats tests; save the log
                        under validation/
